Once you download the WSL2 make sure to follow these steps
1) Write 
wsl.exe --list --online 
download (for this specifically ) 
wsl.exe --install kali linux
2) The powershell will change styles as of a kali linux cmd this means the download was successful
3) go to the settings in docker and in the resources window you will fimd "wsl integraton" if the WSL install was successful it will show you the distribution you downloaded
4) Thats it you have now integrated it with docker
